why: Exists stops asking, which is the shape a twentieth routine written next year takes: nineteen refuse and one does not, and the one is where the program stops. Exists is first in the case, so the whole golden goes.
--- old
  if HoldsNul(path) then Exists := false
  else Exists := ExtAccess(path, 0) = 0
